  "limitations": "Only 16 short texts; not a sufficient general-language corpus or a demonstrated learning improvement. Publisher reading levels describe text complexity, not human ages or model mastery. Images are absent, some meaning relies on illustrations, and stories are not factual answer keys. Whole-story holdouts share language patterns and some authors with training; exact-overlap checks do not rule out paraphrases.",
